Sonar Installation :

Download Sonarqube - Community Version zip file

MOVE your zip file to /opt

# mv sonar....zip /opt

STEP-1: cd /opt/ 
STEP-2: unzip filename 
STEP-3: useradd sonar 
STEP-4: chown sonar:sonar filename  -R 
STEP-5: chmod 777 filename -R 
STEP-6: su - sonar 
STEP-7: cd /opt 
STEP-8: cd sonar—/bin/linux/ 
./sonar.sh start 
./sonar status 
